		{"id":"ppj-exec-summary","type":"text","text":"PUR_GDIAutomation_v1.0.0\n\nDomain:\nSourcing / Purchasing\n\nLifecycle:\nAnalysis / Solution Redesign\n\nProgress:\nTBD\n\nGate:\nWFX API integration and GDI data-entry workflow\n\nOutcome:\nGive Purchasing end-to-end package-dispatch tracking through GDI and provide API capability for automated/assisted GDI data entry while preserving WFX transaction control, validation, confirmation and audit.\n\nTop Blocker:\nWFX API ownership and sandbox\n\nNext Milestone:\nObtain WFX API authentication and operation documentation\n\nLast Verified:\n2026-09-18","x":0,"y":-90,"width":760,"height":560,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ppj-board-metadata","type":"text","text":"PUR_GDIAutomation_v1.0.0 — Executive Project Board\nBoard schema: PPJ_PROJECT_BOARD_V1","x":0,"y":-220,"width":760,"height":100,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"ppj-management-attention","type":"text","text":"KEY MANAGEMENT ATTENTION\n\nTop Risks\n- WFX API ownership and sandbox\n- Authentication and rate limits\n- Transaction integrity\n\nDecisions Needed\n- None recorded\n\nExternal Dependencies\n- WFX API -> Business validation -> Controlled GDI transaction -> Confirmation / Audit","x":810,"y":-90,"width":500,"height":560,"color":"1"},
